# .dockerignore — context filter for `docker build -f apps/server/Dockerfile .`
#
# Goal: keep the build context lean. The server image only needs pnpm workspace
# manifests + packages/* to build the runtime bundle. Everything Electron-
# specific (695MB dist, renderer, main, preload), test harnesses, docs, and
# tooling is excluded.
#
# Exceptions (`!`) re-include files the Dockerfile explicitly COPYs.

# ── Build artifacts & dependencies (will be installed inside the image) ───────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.cache
**/.turbo
**/.parcel-cache
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# ── Electron app (only apps/electron/package.json is needed by tsup) ──────────
apps/electron/dist
apps/electron/renderer
apps/electron/main
apps/electron/preload
apps/electron/resources
apps/electron/scripts
apps/electron/node_modules
# Re-include the manifest tsup reads for XYZ_AGENT_VERSION injection.
!apps/electron/package.json

# NOTE: packages/renderer (4.6MB, @xyz-agent/frontend) is intentionally kept —
# it is an apps/electron workspace dependency and the lockfile resolution fails
# without it. It is never executed in the server image.

# ── Version control & OS cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# ── Docs, harnesses, tooling, CI (not needed to build the runtime) ────────────
docs
e2e
tools
scripts
# Note: scripts/ used to be re-included for fix-node-pty-permissions.sh, but the
# Dockerfile now uses `pnpm install --ignore-scripts` (root postinstall skipped),
# so neither scripts/ nor the helper is needed in the build context.
.github
.changeset
.cw
.agents
.zcode
.impeccable
.superpowers
.v3-audit
.xyz-harness
session-data
taste-lint
playwright-report
test-results
blob-report

# ── Top-level markdown (keep runtime README so the tgz ships it) ──────────────
*.md
!packages/runtime/README.md
!apps/server/README.md
!README.md

# ── Env, logs, local state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/playwright/.cache
.env.example

# ── pi binary cache & local installs (never needed in the image) ──────────────
.pi
.pi-binary-cache
resources/pi
